<title>ITALY: Olivetti can't comment on board meeting report.</title>
<headline>Olivetti can't comment on board meeting report.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olivetti said it could not comment on a report in the International Herald Tribune that its board would hold an emergency meeting on Wednesday evening.</p>
<p>The newspaper cited company officials speaking on condition of anonymity who said there could be a management shake-up which could result in the ousting of chief executive Francesco Caio.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for Olivetti said she was unable to comment on the report.</p>
</text>
